.TH FL-SCREENSHOT 1 "November 2026" "fldesktop 0.1.0" "fldesktop"
.SH NAME
fl-screenshot \- take a screenshot
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfl-screenshot\fR [\fB\-\-area\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Saves a screenshot of all outputs (or of a selected area with \fB\-\-area\fR) to
~/Pictures/Screenshots using grim(1) and slurp(1), and copies it to the clipboard when
wl-copy(1) is available.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBfl-wm\fR(1), \fBfl-session\fR(1), \fBfl-panel\fR(1)
